== Notes ==
* {{i|Lost Contact}} will still block all incoming projectiles from his barrage, even if they happen to go high enough to be offscreen.

== Trivia ==
* He is the boss version of the {{e|Fatty|text=Fatties}}.
* {{E|The Cage}} is the posthumous version of Mega Fatty.
* The picture of Mega Fatty on [[Isaac's last will]] closely resembles the unused variant.

